<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>Manufacturing</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">Yarrow does not own or operate, and
currently has no plans to establish, any manufacturing facilities. Yarrow relies on and expects to continue to rely on GenSci and/or third-party
CDMOs for the manufacturing of YB-101 and related raw materials for clinical development, as well as for the commercial manufacturing
